    Base (English) catalogue. Every user-facing string on Android lives here;
    translations sit in values-<locale>/strings.xml.

    Labels are stored in natural case. The view layer applies .uppercase() where
    the design calls for caps, matching Apple's .textCase(.uppercase) — that way
    scripts without case (CJK) are left alone.
-->
